  "body": "Set on an extraordinary 6,356sqm of private grounds, this monumental solid concrete mansion presents an irreplaceable Auckland estate, created for those who want to live life without compromise.\r\n\r\nOriginally architecturally designed by Sumich Chaplin, the approx. 2,345sqm residence carries a commanding sense of proportion, strength and permanence. North-facing and beautifully positioned to capture bright natural sunlight, the home enjoys remarkable outlooks across the water, with stunning views towards Rangitoto.\r\n\r\nIts solid construction and grand design create a home of enduring substance, where every room feels generous, considered and ready for both family life and exceptional occasions.\r\n\r\nThe main house offers eight bedrooms, each with its own bathroom, providing exceptional comfort and privacy for family members and guests. The huge master bedroom is a true private retreat, generous in scale and designed to enjoy the home’s sense of light, outlook and luxury. Self-contained guest quarters further enhance the flexibility of the residence, allowing extended family, guests, long stays or live-in support to enjoy their own sense of comfort and independence.\r\n\r\nMultiple living and entertaining spaces allow the home to adapt beautifully, from quiet evenings together to large celebrations with friends and family.\r\n\r\nThis is a home designed for those who value privacy, leisure and space at the highest level. Begin the day in complete comfort, with a swim in the indoor pool, a workout in the gym, or a quiet coffee overlooking the estate and water views. Spend summer afternoons beside the outdoor pool or on the full-size tennis court, then move into the private theatre, billiards room, wine cellar or bar as the day becomes evening. From family celebrations to formal entertaining, every part of the home supports a life lived with ease, freedom and distinction.\r\n\r\nWith lift access across levels and exceptional 12-car garaging, the estate delivers remarkable practicality. The main home also includes a separate dwelling, formerly used as a squash court, adding another distinctive element to this rare offering.\r\n\r\nDespite its privacy and scale, the estate remains wonderfully connected to daily essentials and lifestyle amenities. Just minutes from the CBD, the address is also within strolling distance of Madill’s Farm and Kohimarama Beach, with Eastridge Shopping, St Heliers Bay Village, the beach and top private schools all nearby. It brings a relaxed, holiday-like beach lifestyle into daily living, while keeping everyday conveniences within easy reach.\r\n\r\nHeld across two titles with separate driveways and zoned Mixed Housing Urban, the property offers outstanding flexibility and future potential, subject to council approval.\r\n\r\nSolid, private and genuinely irreplaceable, this is a rare Auckland estate for those who recognise something truly exceptional.",
